  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Accountability to Affected Populations for conflict-affected people in Moc&#xed;mboa da Praia District of Cabo Delgado, Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project focuses on strengthening Accountability to Affected Populations in Mocimboa de Praia (MdP) district of Cabo Delgado, Mozambique. The project enhances community engagement and information dissemination among conflict-affected individuals. Through improved complaints and feedback mechanisms, increased access to information and the establishment of community-based information sharing mechanisms, the International Organization for Migration (IOM) is working to ensure the voices of conflict-affected people in vulnerable situations, including women and individuals with disabilities, are heard and their needs addressed.</narrative>
  </description>
